# Spring backend

- Java 17, Spring Boot 3.4.x, Maven, root package `com.nammamedmate.server`.
- Flow is `feature → application → persistence + domain`; controllers never
  call repositories. External adapters and security live in `infrastructure`.
- Use constructor injection, record DTOs, `ApiResponse<T>`, `ApiException`,
  and `@Transactional` application write methods.
- Every pharmacy-owned query includes `tenant_id`; branch-owned queries also
  include `branch_id`, including counts, exports, existence checks, jobs, and
  notification recipients.
- Add the next immutable Flyway migration; never edit an applied migration.
- Persist money as integer paise and timestamps in UTC.
- Validate authorization, retries, idempotency, concurrency, and rollback.
- Test HTTP validation, business branches, persistence, cross-tenant and
  cross-branch denial, and retry/concurrency behavior.
